{
  "name": "dsh-social-simulation",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "百万 agent 社交模拟：可扩展开源社媒模拟器，LLM agent 逼真模仿 Twitter/Reddit 上多达百万用户——23 种动作（follow/comment/repost）、兴趣与热度推荐算法、动态环境；研究信息传播/群体极化/羊群行为等社会现象。受 camel-ai/oasis（5k★ Apache-2.0）启发。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skills",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "skill",
    "simulation",
    "social",
    "agents",
    "oasis",
    "社交模拟"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dependencies": {
    "yaml": "^2.4.2"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/satan9394/dsh-public"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.0.0"
  }
}
